If a patient has a taper-progress-failure-despite-opioid-related-harm then the patient can possibly have an undiagnosed-opioid-use-disorder.
If a patient has an unanticipated-tapering-challenge then the patient can possibly have an undiagnosed-opioid-use-disorder.
An unanticipated-tapering-challenge-example is a taper-progress-failure-despite-opioid-related-harm-example.
